aph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-F45B0A4D-D370-49BD-A651-BBD905CDDCEE\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-3B81C779-1266-469C-9A96-887CAF4BB8E3\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-AEF27A26-3275-4B32-8296-E533F06FBD6C\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-320C8465-1CB0-4643-8592-47FD7988B72F\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-42245AEE-7C50-4BAE-85C6-19FB884A68AE\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-161FD7D2-22B4-479E-B392-D9137C064F1D\">같이 하실 분??</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-37331C00-8BE1-49B5-9A13-933F98BA442A\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-BA454F7B-90C0-42D6-BB4F-1FD7274BD297\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_bubble\" id=\"SE-c9a0db93-3a25-4c31-a2a0-9b10c3fe2944\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_bubble\">\n                            <blockquote class=\"se-quotation-container\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-text se-quote\"><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-356e9377-e03d-462a-9d50-4efd13a5272e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8f56071c-8e9a-4742-a20f-c33334484e61\">어떻게 써야 할지 모르겠다구요??</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --></div>\n                            </blockquote>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-32970094-538f-4e3e-8b64-ba8ae3092af6\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dc1e56ea-91bd-4387-8979-4834c72c6850\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f4711e36-1574-4831-b4cb-8ea4334cf8a4\">여기에 다 나와있습니다 ㅎㅎ</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-oglink se-l-text\" id=\"SE-96e43c49-b54f-488a-9c89-b2f44493f174\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-oglink se-l-text se-section-align-\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-oglink\">\n                                <a href=\"https://cafe.naver.com/ranschool/5872\" class=\"se-oglink-info\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                    <div class=\"se-oglink-info-container\">\n                                        <strong class=\"se-oglink-title\">[신규 회원 필독] 주는사란 카페 이용 가이드 (23.07.18업데이트)</strong>\n                                        <p class=\"se-oglink-summary\">안녕하세요😊 주는사란 카페에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 아직 카페가 낯선 여러분들을 위해 주는사란 카페를 100% 활용할 수 있도록 도와드리고자 하나씩 정리해 보았습니다. ...</p>\n                                        <p class=\"se-oglink-url\">cafe.naver.com</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module='{\"type\":\"v2_oglink\", \"id\" :\"SE-96e43c49-b54f-488a-9c89-b2f44493f174\", \"data\" : {\"